  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the dog as the subject of the pun",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the dog, which is being mapped as 'her' in the textual material. The humor relies on the user identifying with the dog as the subject of the statement 'you can't get her pregnant if she's a goat,' where 'her' refers to the dog. This projection is implicit, as the meme uses the dog as a visual anchor for the pun, and the user must mentally map themselves onto the dog to understand the joke. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the projection is onto the dog as the entity being described.",
